time by seamlessly integrating powerful timer functionality directly into your real-world environment.\n# Key Features \n- **True Mixed Reality (MR) Integration**: Don't just view a timer\u2014place it on any surface in your room: your wall, your desk, your whiteboard. Once placed, it stays there until you move it.\n- **Intuitive Hand Tracking**: No controllers needed. Create and position timers with simple, natural gestures.\n- **Multiple Timers, Endless Possibilities**: Run as many timers as you need simultaneously. Track your focus time, break time, and board game turns\u2014all at once, all at a glance.\n\n- **Minimalist, Unobtrusive Design**: A clean, elegant interface that gives you the information you need without cluttering your space. Stay focused on your task, not the tool.\n", "short_description": "Bring time into your world. Place, pinch, and manage multiple timers with just your hands. The perfect minimalist utility for productivity, fitness, cooking, and more."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "New Story Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25099243173005614"}}]}, "scheduled_offers":